{
  "name": "SystemArchitecture",
  "internal_name": "SystemArchitecture",
  "focus": "High-level component and flow overview of the Marginswap Solidity system: external traders and token/AMM interfaces; role and service discovery; router-mediated isolated and cross-margin operations; lending and bond accounting; collateral custody and disbursement through Fund; price conversion and liquidation; and incentive distribution. Show contract inheritance or module dependencies, caller-to-contract control flow, asset and valuation data flow, and the boundary between protocol contracts and external tokens, WETH, AMM pairs, and users.",
